                        <h2>Privacy Policy of First Aid Made Easy</h2>

                        <h3>Introduction</h3>
                        <p>Thank you for choosing First Aid Made Easy and visiting this site for the first time. Just as we value your trust, we value your privacy and make sure to comply with your request. This policy explains how we gather and handle your personal data to ensure your privacy and protection every time you visit our site https://firstaidmadeeasy.com.pk or use our services such as first aid training, certification courses, and training. </p>

                        <h3>What Information Do We Collect</h3>
                        <p>In the course of your interactions with First Aid Made Easy, the following types of data can be collected:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Users are asked to submit their full names, contact email addresses, and phone numbers whenever they sign up for our courses, contact us, or subscribe to our newsletters.</li>
                            <li><strong>User Information:</strong> This might be the starting and ending times of the user's screens, the pages visited, the type of browser in use, the user's IP Address, and other general information.</li>
                            <li><strong>Cookies & Tracking:</strong> We examine and enhance the data gathered from unique users to the website in order to improve user experience, website traffic, and performance.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3>Purpose of Having Your Information</h3>
                        <p>Your information can be used for the following purposes:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Service Delivery:</strong> We promptly reply to your queries in order to enroll you in our programs and first aid training.</li>
                            <li><strong>Communication:</strong> We send newsletters and updates about the services to the subscribers. If you wish to remove any of the trainings you have signed up to, feel free to do so. </li>
                            <li><strong>Website Improvement:</strong> We collect this to assess the site’s performance from other data sets to plan enhancements to our training and other services.Website Improvement: We collect this to assess the site’s performance from other data sets to plan enhancements to our training and other services.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3>Sharing of Information</h3>
                        <p>
                            The Company, under no circumstances, may sell, trade, or rent your information to any party for any purpose at any time. However, information may be shared on the following bases:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>To Perform Services:</strong> Under the terms of the agreement, the following parties are bound to keep strict confidentiality: bona fide operational service professionals, payment processors, and website and communication managers.</li>
                            <li><strong>As Required by Law:</strong> The organization’s rights and properties, along with the user’s safety, and the organization’s rights and properties, may be revealed on and/or behalf of the Company in the following situations, and/or to the following parties. </li>
                        </ul>


                        <h3>The Security of Information</h3>
                        <p>
                            Information, as it stands, is completely susceptible to loss and alteration with no safeguards in place. However, the above-mentioned methods of electronic storage, transmission, and safe keeping are the safest, most accessible, and least risky to the above mentioned concerns.
                        </p>

                        <h3>User Rights</h3>
                        <p>Your rights are to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Access, modify and erase personal information that the Company holds.</li>
                            <li>Stop the Company from sending unsolicited marketing emails.</li>
                            <li>Submit a request to the Company to stop any personal data processing.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <h3>Policy Changes</h3>
                        <p>The Company may change the terms of this policy at any time, on a discretionary basis, to better suit the company's activities and the industry, to modify the company's service, to adjust to any course of applicable legislation. Changes to the Privacy Policy will be updated on the Company's site. Continuing to use the Company services will be seen as agreeing to the policy changes.</p>

                        <h3>Contact Us</h3>
                        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Email:</strong> info@firstaidmadeeasy.com.pk</li>
                            <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +92 (318) 0049-742</li>
                            <li><strong>Website:</strong> https://firstaidmadeeasy.com.pk</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
